---
import "../styles/fonts.css";
import "../styles/homepage.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Website design and development for AI and tech startups. Start with a $1,499 homepage concept, a focused design and build sprint, or a monthly project.">
  <title>Unroot Design, website design and build for AI and tech startups</title>

</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <aside class="rail">
      <div class="rail-top">
        <a class="logo" href="#top">unroot<span>.</span></a>
        <button class="command-button" type="button" data-open-command><span>Search</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>
      </div>

      <div class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="availability"><i></i><span>Warsaw studio. Working worldwide.</span></div>
        <h1>Websites for AI and tech startups.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy"><strong>We design and build your website.</strong> Start with a homepage concept before committing to the full project. Work directly with our five-person team.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#concept"><span>get a concept, $1,499</span><span>↘</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Intro%20call"><span>book call</span><span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><strong>9 years</strong><span>in design &amp; development</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>100+</strong><span>brands served</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>$130M+</strong><span>raised by clients</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rail-foot">
        <nav><a href="#work">work</a><a href="#pricing">pricing</a><a href="#team">team</a><a href="#faq">faq</a></nav>
        <span>Warsaw, Poland</span>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="feed">
      <header class="feed-nav">
        <a class="mobile-brand" href="#top">unroot.</a>
        <strong>Website design &amp; development</strong>
        <nav><a href="#concept">Concept</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#footer">Contact</a></nav>
      </header>

      <section class="section" id="concept">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div><span class="kicker">01, homepage concept</span><h2>See the design before you commit.</h2></div>
          <p>Send your website. We design one homepage direction in Figma: a hero, three sections and a scroll preview. Delivered in 7 days for $1,499.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="concept-stage">
          <div class="concept-toolbar">
            <div class="project-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Concept examples">
              <button class="project-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-project="Javelin VP" data-before="/homepage/img/p-javelin-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-javelin-after.jpg">Javelin VP</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Switch" data-before="/homepage/img/p-switch-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-switch-after.jpg">Switch</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Epsilon Health" data-before="/homepage/img/p-epsilon-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-epsilon-after.jpg">Epsilon</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Ambient Dreamie" data-before="/homepage/img/p-dreamie-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-dreamie-after.jpg">Dreamie</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="ResumAI" data-before="/homepage/img/p-resumai-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-resumai-after.jpg">ResumAI</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Leadgains" data-before="/homepage/img/p-leadgains-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-leadgains-after.jpg">Leadgains</button>
            </div>
            <div class="concept-price">drag to compare</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare" data-compare>
            <div class="compare-panel compare-before">
              <img data-before-image src="/homepage/img/p-javelin-before.jpg" alt="Javelin VP website before redesign" width="620" height="1033" fetchpriority="high">
              <span class="mock-label" data-before-label>Before, Javelin VP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-panel compare-after" data-after>
              <img data-concept-image src="/homepage/img/p-javelin-after.jpg" alt="Javelin VP homepage concept" width="620" height="1033">
              <span class="mock-label" data-after-label>7 day concept, Javelin VP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-handle" data-handle></div>
            <input class="compare-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="56" aria-label="Reveal the homepage concept" data-compare-range>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-caption"><span>Drag to compare the original website with our homepage concept.</span><span>Select a project above to explore another direction.</span></div>

        <div class="concept-details">
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>A defined scope. A file you keep.</h3>
            <p>One design direction, with no revisions or development included. The Figma file is yours. Continue with a full redesign within 60 days and we credit the $1,499 toward it.</p>
            <div class="offer-points">
              <div><strong>hero + 3 sections</strong>One homepage direction in Figma.</div>
              <div><strong>animated preview</strong>See how the page moves on scroll.</div>
              <div><strong>7 days</strong>Delivery after payment and your website link.</div>
              <div><strong>yours to keep</strong>Keep the design, whether we build it or not.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-card"><div><span class="kicker">Homepage Concept</span><div class="big">$1,499</div><span class="offer-delivery">Delivered in 7 days</span></div><p>Decide on the design before booking the full website.</p></div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="play-head"><div><span class="kicker">02, concept board</span><p>More homepage concepts. Drag the covers to explore.</p></div><button class="reset" type="button" data-reset>reset board</button></div>
        <div class="play-card">
          <div class="board" data-board>
            <div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-oramedia.jpg" alt="Oramedia concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Oramedia</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-resumai.jpg" alt="ResumAI concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>ResumAI</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-rezi.jpg" alt="Rezi concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Rezi</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-switch.jpg" alt="Switch concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Switch</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-dreamie.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Ambient Dreamie</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-leadgains.jpg" alt="Leadgains concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Leadgains</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="work">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">03, shipped work</span><h2>Selected websites we designed and built.</h2></div><p>Work for venture capital, finance, health and film businesses.</p></div>
        <div class="work-grid">
          <article class="case" id="work-dreamie"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-1.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-2.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-3.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Ambient Dreamie</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Brand identity, 3D visuals and a website for a company making light-based sleep products.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">brand</span><span class="tag">3d</span><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">healthtech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-switch"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-1.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-2.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-3.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Switch image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Switch image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Switch image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Switch</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>A website for a group finance platform with shared accounts, MoneyPools and instant payments.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">fintech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-javelinvp"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-1.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-2.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-3.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Javelin VP</h3><span class="case-year">2024</span></div><p>Website redesign and development for a venture capital fund. Migrated from WordPress to Webflow.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">vc</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-trustyfy"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-1.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-2.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-3.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Trustyfy</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>A website for a payments business offering crypto and fiat wallets, cards and transfers.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">fintech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-workshop-film-co"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-1.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-2.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-3.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Workshop Film Co.</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Brand identity and a website for a production studio making commercials and brand films.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">brand</span><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">film</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-epsilon-health"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-1.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-2.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-3.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Epsilon Health</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>A website for a MedTech company building software for radiology imaging workflows.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">medtech</span></div></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="process">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">04, from concept to website</span><h2>Start with the concept. Decide what comes next.</h2></div><p>The concept is a separate purchase. You can continue with us or take the design elsewhere.</p></div>
        <div class="process">
          <article class="step"><strong>Day 1</strong><div><h3>Send the link.</h3><p>Send your current website and pay for the concept. No kickoff call required.</p></div></article>
          <article class="step"><strong>Day 7</strong><div><h3>Review the direction.</h3><p>Receive your Figma concept and scroll preview. Keep the files, whether or not you continue.</p></div></article>
          <article class="step"><strong>If you continue</strong><div><h3>Design and build.</h3><p>We agree the remaining scope, design and build the website, then hand over the project and CMS.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="pricing">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">05, pricing</span><h2>Choose the work you need.</h2></div><p>Buy a design direction, a week of work on defined tasks, or a month with a designer and developer.</p></div>
        <div class="pricing">
          <article class="price-card featured">
            <span class="label">Homepage Concept</span><div class="price">$1,499</div>
            <span class="price-term">Fixed deliverable · 7-day delivery</span>
            <h3>Find your design direction.</h3>
            <p>For a website that needs a new look before you commit to the full redesign.</p>
            <ul><li>One Figma direction: hero + 3 sections</li><li>Animated scroll preview</li><li>No revisions or development</li><li>$1,499 credited toward a redesign within 60 days</li></ul>
            <div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Homepage%20Concept"><span>Get a concept</span><span>↗</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="price-card sprint-card">
            <span class="label">Design &amp; Build Sprint</span><div class="price">$2,499</div>
            <span class="price-term">Focused work · One working week</span>
            <h3>Move defined tasks forward.</h3>
            <p>For when you know what needs doing and need design, development, or both.</p>
            <ul><li>Work on your agreed priorities</li><li>Direct contact in a private Slack channel</li><li>Daily progress to review</li><li>Ends on Friday. No ongoing commitment</li></ul>
            <div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Design%20and%20Build%20Sprint"><span>Discuss a sprint</span><span>↗</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="price-card">
            <span class="label">Monthly Design &amp; Build</span><div class="price">$7,899</div>
            <span class="price-term">Project work · Four weeks</span>
            <h3>Book a month for the website.</h3>
            <p>A landing page designed and built, or a full website designed, within four weeks.</p>
            <ul><li>Senior designer, developer and art direction</li><li>Unlimited requests, prioritised within the month</li><li>Private Slack channel and weekly updates</li><li>Pause or stop before the next block</li></ul>
            <div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Monthly%20project"><span>Discuss a project</span><span>↗</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="reviews">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">06, clients</span><h2>What clients say.</h2></div><p>Read the original reviews using the Trustpilot links below.</p></div>
        <div class="review-carousel" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Client reviews">
        <div class="quotes" id="review-slides">
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 4"><blockquote>“We could not have been happier with his work and strongly recommend him to any future clients. He is creative and very timely with responses.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-tasnia.jpg" alt="Tasnia Huque" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Tasnia Huque</strong><span>Principal at Javelin VP</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68811a779569d1770b673aba" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“Collaboration was smooth from design through build, and they handled every detail with care.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-adrian.jpg" alt="Adrian Canoso" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Adrian Canoso</strong><span>CEO and Co-Founder at Ambient Dreamie</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68dad10cbf77717f3c8e7895" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“Adam and his team excel in both design and development, consistently delivering high-quality work with clear and timely communication.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-jonah.jpg" alt="Jonah Neuss" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Jonah Neuss</strong><span>Wow House Studio</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68800cfb2b8ce173b31d4fce" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“The designs are honestly some of the coolest stuff I have seen out there.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-rokas.jpg" alt="Rokas Judickas" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Rokas Judickas</strong><span>Founding designer at Sintra.ai</span></div></footer></article>
        </div>
        <div class="review-controls">
          <button type="button" data-review-prev aria-label="Previous review" aria-controls="review-slides">←</button>
          <button type="button" data-review-next aria-label="Next review" aria-controls="review-slides">→</button>
          <span class="review-count" data-review-count role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Review 1 of 4</span>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="services">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">07, services</span><h2>What we do.</h2></div><p>From brand identity and page design to development and CMS handover.</p></div>
        <div class="list-card"><div class="list-title">Services</div><div class="list-row"><span>Website design</span><span>Figma</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Website development</span><span>Webflow &amp; Framer</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Custom development</span><span>Code</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Logo and brand identity</span><span>brand</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Design systems</span><span>systems</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>3D and motion</span><span>visuals</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Landing pages</span><span>launch</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>CMS setup and training</span><span>handover</span></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="team">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">08, team</span><h2>Meet the team doing the work.</h2></div><p>Adam leads design and manages your project. You work directly with the designers and developer.</p></div>
        <div class="list-card"><div class="list-title">Team</div><div class="list-row"><span>Adam</span><span>design, runs projects</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Eugenia</span><span>senior design</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Alex</span><span>development</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Igor</span><span>design</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Yuliia</span><span>design</span></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="faq">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">09, faq</span><h2>Scope, process and handover.</h2></div><p>What is included, how we work and what you receive.</p></div>
        <div class="faq">
          <details><summary>What is included in the Homepage Concept?</summary><p>One homepage direction in Figma: a hero, three sections and an animated scroll preview. The price is $1,499, with delivery in 7 days after payment and receipt of your website link. Development and revisions are not included.</p></details>
          <details><summary>How is the Concept different from a Sprint?</summary><p>The Concept buys a fixed design deliverable. The Sprint buys one working week of design or development on agreed tasks. Choose the Concept to explore a redesign direction; choose the Sprint when you already know what needs doing.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Do I have to book the full website afterwards?</summary><p>No. The concept file is yours to keep and use with another team. If you book the full redesign with us within 60 days, the $1,499 is credited toward it.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Are concept revisions included?</summary><p>No. The Concept includes one direction without revisions. Further design work can be scoped as a separate project.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can I share context before you start?</summary><p>Yes. Send your website and any goals or constraints you want us to consider. A formal brief, moodboard or kickoff call is not required for the Concept.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can my team edit the finished website?</summary><p>Yes. Webflow and Framer projects include CMS setup and training so your team can update content and publish without asking us to make each change.</p></details>
          <details><summary>How do we communicate during a project?</summary><p>You get a private Slack channel with the people doing the work. Sprints include daily progress; monthly projects include weekly updates.</p></details>
          <details><summary>How do you use AI?</summary><p>We use AI-assisted coding during development. Our team makes the design decisions and is responsible for the implementation.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What do you hand over?</summary><p>The Figma files and finished Webflow, Framer or code project, along with CMS training where applicable. The Concept purchase includes the design file and scroll preview; it does not include a built website.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer" id="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="footer-heading">
        <h2 id="footer-heading">Send us your website.</h2>
        <p>Tell us what needs to change. We can start with a homepage concept or discuss the design and development work you need.</p>
        <div class="closing-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Concept"><span>get a concept</span><span>$1,499 ↗</span></a>
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Intro%20call"><span>book call</span><span>15 min ↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="footer-grid">
    <div><h4>browse</h4><ul>
      <li><a href="#concept">Concept</a></li>
      <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="/redesign">Redesign</a></li>
      <li><span>Templates</span></li>
      <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="/careers">Careers</a></li></ul></div>

    <div><h4>work</h4><ul>
      <li><a href="#work-dreamie">Ambient Dreamie</a></li>
